{"decisions":[{"id":"dc_6901c72fb7","n":8,"mod":"exp","text":"用相同的三个种子在三个文档长度上比较各组。显存预算减半时单列文档中部证据的问答结果。","source":"written","ref":null,"state":"active","replaces":"dc_2f4f822987","materials":[],"matter":null,"created_at":"2026-11-25T17:29:36+00:00","ended_at":null,"replaced_by":null,"counts":{"jobs":0,"outputs":1,"tells":0,"tasks":0,"prov":0}},{"id":"dc_e28200d21d","n":7,"mod":"agents","text":"代码员工记录缓存峰值和吞吐，负责人复核测量条件，写作员工按证据位置整理图注。","source":"written","ref":null,"state":"active","replaces":null,"materials":[],"matter":null,"created_at":"2026-11-25T17:29:36+00:00","ended_at":null,"replaced_by":null,"counts":{"jobs":0,"outputs":0,"tells":0,"tasks":0,"prov":0}},{"id":"dc_07ed5df08b","n":6,"mod":"paper","text":"先画缓存预算与答案精度的关系，再展示证据位置分组。速度结论只采用同一批次下的测量。","source":"written","ref":null,"state":"active","replaces":null,"materials":[],"matter":null,"created_at":"2026-11-25T17:29:36+00:00","ended_at":null,"replaced_by":null,"counts":{"jobs":0,"outputs":0,"tells":0,"tasks":0,"prov":0}},{"id":"dc_1f8729d62e","n":5,"mod":"data","text":"按证据所在的文首、中部和文末分层抽取长文档。记录答案精确匹配率、证据召回率和峰值缓存降幅。","source":"written","ref":null,"state":"active","replaces":null,"materials":[],"matter":null,"created_at":"2026-11-25T17:29:36+00:00","ended_at":null,"replaced_by":null,"counts":{"jobs":0,"outputs":2,"tells":0,"tasks":0,"prov":0}},{"id":"dc_2f4f822987","n":4,"mod":"exp","text":"先固定文档长度，只比较两种缓存精度。","source":"written","ref":null,"state":"replaced","replaces":null,"materials":[],"matter":null,"created_at":"2026-11-25T17:29:36+00:00","ended_at":"2026-11-25T17:29:36+00:00","replaced_by":"dc_6901c72fb7","counts":{"jobs":0,"outputs":0,"tells":0,"tasks":0,"prov":0}},{"id":"dc_c676353180","n":3,"mod":"code","text":"保留问题词和高注意力位置的缓存，其余位置量化保存。记录每个被保留位置的层号和文档偏移。","source":"written","ref":null,"state":"active","replaces":null,"materials":[],"matter":null,"created_at":"2026-11-25T17:29:36+00:00","ended_at":null,"replaced_by":null,"counts":{"jobs":0,"outputs":1,"tells":0,"tasks":0,"prov":0}},{"id":"dc_f718952f2f","n":2,"mod":"survey","text":"用 Full cache、Sliding window、Uniform cache quantization 作对照。逐组核对输入条件与评测预算。","source":"written","ref":null,"state":"active","replaces":null,"materials":[{"kind":"paper","ref":"arxiv:2604.20920","title":"Simplified Sparse Attention via Gist Tokens"}],"matter":null,"created_at":"2026-11-25T17:29:36+00:00","ended_at":null,"replaced_by":null,"counts":{"jobs":0,"outputs":1,"tells":0,"tasks":0,"prov":0}},{"id":"dc_3275d9498f","n":1,"mod":"overview","text":"长上下文推理加速：用稀疏注意力挑出关键 token，再对 KV cache 做分层压缩，显存减半时保持长文档问答的精度","source":"idea","ref":null,"state":"active","replaces":null,"materials":[],"matter":null,"created_at":"2026-11-25T17:29:36+00:00","ended_at":null,"replaced_by":null,"counts":{"jobs":0,"outputs":2,"tells":0,"tasks":0,"prov":0}}],"matters":[{"id":6,"agent":"lead-line_3","who":"项目负责人","question":"下一轮应如何设置生成阶段的批大小？","mod":"exp","facts":["方法草案固定了缓存预算和文档长度。","现有样例结果表按准确率与缓存降幅汇总，尚未区分批大小。"],"options":["固定批大小比较单次延迟","在相同缓存上限下分别测量吞吐"],"materials":[{"kind":"paper","ref":"arxiv:2604.20920","title":"Simplified Sparse Attention via Gist Tokens"}],"since":"2026-11-25T17:29:36+00:00"}],"loose":[],"stats":{"total":8,"active":7,"anchored":3,"loose":0},"mods":[{"id":"overview","name":"概览"},{"id":"survey","name":"调研"},{"id":"code","name":"代码仓库"},{"id":"exp","name":"实验"},{"id":"data","name":"数据"},{"id":"paper","name":"论文"},{"id":"agents","name":"员工"}]}